            <div type="translation" xml:lang="en" resp="#AA">
                <p>
                    To Lucius Volcacius Primus, son of Quintus, of tribe Velina, quinquennial duovir twice, flamen of all the divi,
                    patron of the colony. This was set up in accordance with his will, when Quintus Licinius Crispinus and Gaius 
                    Herennius Maximus who duovirs.
                </p>
            </div>
            <div type="commentary"> <!-- Same name as 394 but holds an extra duovirate, and not all of the military posts? -->
